                    </persName>
                    <birth when="1000">
                        <placeName> </placeName>
                    </birth>
                    <death when="1850-01-08"/>
                    <occupation/>
                    <occupation/>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Holcroft's daughter by his second marriage. Coded as part of the plural 
    Miss Holcroft's Godwin records in the 1790s. She marries William Cole in 1794 and is entered as 
    S Cole or Mrs Cole, or as part of Coles.  After Cole's death she maries <persName key="MER04">Georges Nicholas Mergez</persName>, 
    a Napoleonic General, and appears in the diary as Mme Mergez. Mergez (as Merget) appears in the diary in 1792-3, in association with Holcroft on several occasions.</p>
                    </note>
